  "body": "Currently, The Window and WebWorkers seem to only be allowed to passively receive message in queue.\r\nBut sometimes it is very useful if they can peek next messages in queue if any, when handling the currently-received message. There're cases where later caculations automatically obsolete the previous caculations, if the worker knows there are caculation requests that follow the currently-received request, then it can just simply ignore the current request and all other requests except the last one, and just handle the last one.",
